		<h3>Daily Fiction</h3>
		<h1>The Maltese Version</h1>
		<h2>By Katy Simpson Smith</h2>
		<div class="img-excerpt-container">
			<div class="img-container"><img src="https://s26162.pcdn.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/9780374619480.jpg" alt="The Maltese Version"></div>
			<div class="excerpt-container"><div class="excerpt"><em>The following is from Katy Simpson Smith's </em>The Maltese Version<em>. Born and raised in Jackson, Mississippi, Smith is the author of </em>The Story of Land and Sea, Free Men, The Everlasting, The Weeds,<em> and </em>We Have Raised All of You.<em> Her writing has appeared in </em>The Washington Post, The Paris Review, the Oxford American, Granta<em>, and elsewhere. She teaches in the Bennington Writing Seminars and lives in New Orleans.</em></div></div>
